  "details": "I noticed in the newest open-beta that the zooming feature in the camera now snaps into position instead of smoothly interpolating. I use the smooth zooming immensely for recording purposes as it adds much more character to my shots, having it snap completely removes that. \n\nI do think snap zooming can be useful, so it might be cool if smooth zooming could be added back in when you select \"smooth\" under behavioral settings.",
